.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    See how clear Titles, Positions, and Assignments are by department—so leaders can spot which
    parts of the org need Expectation Alignment work.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-3
    %li
      Each row is a department (plus
      %strong Company-wide
      for records with no department).
    %li
      %strong Titles
      ,
      %strong Positions
      , and
      %strong Assignments
      columns show the average Expectation Alignment Score for scored records in that department, plus scored/total counts.
    %li
      %strong Combined
      is the mean of those three averages when at least one is scored.
    %li
      Use
      %strong Other actions → Refresh all
      to queue Title, Position, and Assignment EAS recalculations. Prefer Refresh after large MAAP edits—not on every page view.
